{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Ai &amp; the Demon &amp; the Curse of Lust&quot; is an RPG game produced by \u5730\u8535\u30b5\u30d0\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u30ca\u30a4\u30c8 and published by Hanabi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demon Communication\u2014a widely rumored urban legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After discussing it with her club friends, Ai returns home only to encounter the rumored demon. Through strange events, she unknowingly signs a contract and is cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, she must uncover the truth and defeat the mastermind in this thrilling RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jrpg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Route selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abundant CG content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captivating story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523690?t=1740480703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523690?t=1740480703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523690/83b7e431d16e56358fecbc025e163a5f809e22fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740480703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523690/83b7e431d16e56358fecbc025e163a5f809e22fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740480703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Ai &amp; the Demon &amp; the Curse of Lust&quot; is an RPG game produced by \u5730\u8535\u30b5\u30d0